      "created_at": "2015-04-16T15:09:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>NOTE: I already logged a bug for this issue I just wanted to know if anyone else experienced this?</p><p>So I love Spite. The character, the style, the mechanics. So I was thrilled i was able to play against him!</p><p>So when I finally got RC, I played him on Advanced. Things were going well, I had a great setup, though he was gaining crazy tons of HP I was not worried. He'd be dead when he finally gets his drugs out. So he finally flipped, then things went for the worse.... He got hyper sonic assaulted the turn before, and when he tried to deal damage instead of playing a card I go the message \"Cannot deal damage\" then the message again about playing a card, can't deal damage, damage instead of card, can't deal damage....on repeat. After a solid 20 times I knew something was off...</p><p>I was heartbroken. I can't beta Spite, and get the confidence in seeing that beautiful incapacitate art.</p><p>So I logged a bug and sent it to the devs.&nbsp;</p><p>Anyone experience this bug as well?</p><p>P.S His leitmotif when he wins (heard from the bio section) is AMAZING</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:31.682Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
